SAF games for Rockbox (YP3 port)

Upstream: https://codeberg.org/drummyfish/SAF (mirror: gitlab.com/drummyfish/SAF),
commit 815ac0cc6db2c4730cda275cd8728b2222b861f2. All code is CC0 1.0 (LICENSE).
saf.h has one added platform branch (SAF_PLATFORM_ROCKBOX -> saf_rockbox.h);
utd.h, minigames.h and tangram.h are the upstream examples with only the
"../saf.h" include path changed. Frontend: saf_rockbox.h, saf_main.h.
Save data (32 bytes) goes to /.rockbox/rocks/games/<name>.sav.
